 64, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 65", "text": "- 전시기간 : ’26. 11. 13.(금) ~ ’27. 1. 21.(일)"}, {"block_index": 46, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 65, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 66", "text": "- 전시장소 : 서울시 중구 을지로 281 DDP 내 둘레길 갤러리 및 둘레길 C구간"}, {"block_index": 47, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 66, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 67", "text": "둘레길 갤러리세부 규격가로 14.9m × 세로 38.5m (면적 312m2)디자인둘레길C"}, {"block_index": 48, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 67, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 68", "text": "둘레길 갤러리"}, {"block_index": 49, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 70, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 71", "text": "세부 규격"}, {"block_index": 50, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 71, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 72", "text": "가로 14.9m × 세로 38.5m (면적 312m2)"}, {"block_index": 51, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 72, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 73", "text": "디자인"}, {"block_index": 52, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 73, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 74", "text": "둘레길C"}, {"block_index": 53, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 79, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 80", "text": "가. 전시장 운영 및 관리 ※ 전염병 및 안전사고 예방활동 포함"}, {"block_index": 54, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 80, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 81", "text": "나. 전시물 안내 해설 및 체험프로그램 운영"}, {"block_index": 55, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 81, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 82", "text": "다. 운영에 필요한 피복 등 구매"}, {"block_index": 56, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 82, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 83", "text": "라. 전시장 운영 관련 기본 유지보수(전시물 제작업체 협력)"}, {"block_index": 57, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 83, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 84", "text": "마. 정기보고 및 관람객 만족도 조사"}, {"block_index": 58, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 84, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 85", "text": "바. 기타 과업목적을 달성하기 위해 필요한 제반업무"}, {"block_index": 59, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 86, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 87", "text": "2. 세부내용"}, {"block_index": 60, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 87, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 88", "text": "가. 전시장 운영 및 관리"}, {"block_index": 61, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 88, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 89", "text": "1) 전시장소, 기간"}, {"block_index": 62, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 89, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 90", "text": "전시장소면적전시기간용역 수행 기간DDP 내 둘레길 갤러리 및 둘레길 C구간면적 312m2 내외 ’26. 11. 13.(금) ~ ’27. 1. 31.(일)’26. 11. 13.(금) ~ ’26. 12. 31.(목)"}, {"block_index": 63, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 90, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 91", "text": "전시장소"}, {"block_index": 64, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 91, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 92", "text": "면적"}, {"block_index": 65, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 92, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 93", "text": "전시기간"}, {"block_index": 66, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 93, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 94", "text": "용역 수행 기간"}, {"block_index": 67, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 94, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 95", "text": "DDP 내 둘레길 갤러리"}, {"block_index": 68, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 95, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 96", "text": "및 둘레길 C구간"}, {"block_index": 69, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 96, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 97", "text": "면적 312m2 내외"}, {"block_index": 70, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 97, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 98", "text": "’26. 11. 13.(금) ~ ’27. 1. 31.(일)"}, {"block_index": 71, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 98, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 99", "text": "’26. 11. 13.(금) ~ ’26. 12. 31.(목)"}, {"block_index": 72, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 99, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 100", "text": "※ DDP 내 전시기간은 위와 같으나 용역 기간은 발주처의 사정에 따라 기간 변동 가능"}, {"block_index": 73, "section_index": 0, "paragraph_index": 100, "location": "section 1 · paragraph 101", "text": "2) 운영시간"}, {"block_index": 74, "secti